  "支持向右、双向、组织三种树形布局，以及导图与大纲视图切换。": "Choose right-facing, balanced, or organization-chart layouts, and switch between map and outline views.",
  "导图节点和白板卡片可关联已有笔记，或直接由节点生成新笔记。": "Link mind map nodes and canvas cards to existing notes, or create a note from a node.",
  "笔记重命名时，[[双向链接]] 与导图引用会自动同步。": "Renaming a note automatically updates its [[wikilinks]] and mind map references.",
  "2.0.0 每日笔记与模板": "2.0.0 Daily notes and templates",
  "首页与桌面侧边栏可一键打开今日笔记，同一天会继续使用已有日记。": "Open today’s note from Home or the desktop sidebar. Opening it again on the same day reuses the existing note.",
  "模板独立于工作区保存，内置日记、日程、代码、学习、会议和项目模板，均可编辑。右键或手机长按笔记选择“设为模板”，也可在模板库中新建，并设置默认日记模板。": "Templates are stored separately from workspaces. Edit the built-in journal, schedule, code, study, meeting, and project templates. Right-click or long-press a note to save it as a template, or create one in the template library and choose a default daily template.",
  "模板支持 {{date}}、{{time}}、{{title}} 与 {{weekday}} 动态变量。": "Templates support the dynamic variables {{date}}, {{time}}, {{title}}, and {{weekday}}.",
  "阅读和分栏支持表格、图片、有序列表、分割线、高亮、删除线和代码一键复制。": "Reading and split views support tables, images, ordered lists, dividers, highlights, strikethrough, and one-click code copying.",
  "外部文件夹笔记的属性和标签会与 Markdown 文件头部的 YAML 双向同步。": "Properties and tags in external-folder notes sync both ways with the Markdown file’s YAML frontmatter.",
  "桌面服务卡片": "Home screen widgets",
  "通过系统桌面的服务卡片入口添加知萤卡片。卡片显示最近同步的工作区内容。": "Add LexiNote widgets from your system’s home screen. They show the most recently synced workspace content.",
  "2×2「灵感速记」可打开文字速记、离线语音面板或今日笔记；打开语音面板后点击录音才会启用麦克风。": "The 2×2 Quick capture widget opens text capture, offline voice input, or today’s note. The microphone starts only when you tap Record.",
  "2×4「今日与回顾」显示今日笔记的待办和一篇旧笔记，点击即可继续记录或回顾。": "The 2×4 Today and review widget shows tasks from today’s note and an older note. Tap to continue writing or review it.",
  "直接点选卡片中的待办即可勾选或取消。内容已变化时会提示，只有真实保存成功后才更新勾选状态。": "Tap a task to check or uncheck it. If the content has changed, you will see a message. Checkmarks update only after a successful save.",
  "保存笔记后卡片自动同步；也可点击刷新。日期变化后打开今日笔记更新待办。": "Widgets sync after you save a note. You can also tap Refresh. Open today’s note after the date changes to update the tasks.",
  "系统分享剪藏": "Capture from system sharing",
  "在支持系统分享的应用中分享选中文字或网页链接，选择「知萤收件箱」。": "Share selected text or a web link from a supported app and choose “LexiNote Inbox”.",
  "保存前可编辑标题、来源和摘录，并选择工作区与项目，预览 Markdown 后再确认。": "Before saving, edit the title, source, and excerpt, select a workspace and project, and review the Markdown preview.",
  "内容保存到「剪藏收件箱」，保留来源链接与剪藏标签；同一次分享重复点击不会创建重复笔记。": "Content is saved to the clipping inbox with its source link and clipping tags. Repeated taps on the same share do not create duplicate notes.",
  "只接收分享面板提供的文字与链接，不会自动下载整篇网页或读取附件。": "Only text and links provided by the share sheet are received. Full web pages and attachments are not downloaded automatically.",
  "跨设备接续": "Continue on another device",
  "打开普通笔记后，可通过支持此功能的鸿蒙设备系统接续入口，继续编辑当前草稿。": "Open a regular note and use your HarmonyOS device’s continuation feature to keep editing the current draft on another device.",
  "两台真机需安装相同版本，登录相同华为账号，并开启系统接续、蓝牙与 WLAN。模拟器不支持跨设备接续。": "Both physical devices need the same app version and HUAWEI ID, with continuation, Bluetooth, and WLAN enabled. Emulators do not support cross-device continuation.",
  "接续保留当前标题、正文、属性、编辑模式与光标位置；接收端内容不同时另存草稿副本，保留双方内容。": "Continuation preserves the title, body, properties, editing mode, and cursor. If the receiving note differs, a draft copy is saved to preserve both versions.",
  "这是单篇编辑状态接续，不会同步整个工作区。草稿传输大小上限约 90 KB，超出时会提示。": "This transfers a single editing session rather than the entire workspace. Drafts are limited to about 90 KB; larger drafts show a message.",
  "离线语音与本地整理": "Offline voice and local organization",
  "手机底部或宽屏编辑器顶部的「工具」中选择「语音 / 整理」，打开后选择需要的功能。": "Choose “Voice / organize” in Tools at the bottom on phones or at the top of the wide-screen editor, then select a feature.",
  "中文离线语音需设备提供相应离线服务与模型。点击「开始录音」才请求麦克风权限，最长 60 秒，可停止或取消；进入后台后停止录音并保留已识别文字。": "Chinese offline speech requires the device’s offline service and model. “Start recording” requests microphone access and records for up to 60 seconds. You can stop or cancel; moving to the background stops recording and keeps recognized text.",
  "识别文字可修改，点击「插入」才写入笔记。不支持离线识别的设备仍可手动输入，应用不会切换到联网识别。": "Edit the transcript and click “Insert” to add it to the note. Devices without offline recognition still support manual input. The app does not fall back to online recognition.",
  "「本地整理」摘录摘要和行动项，并匹配已有笔记链接与标签；逐项选择后插入，原正文保留。设备支持时用离线语义模型对比最近 24 篇可用笔记，模型不可用时保留规则建议，不联网下载。": "Local organization extracts summaries and action items and suggests existing note links and tags. Select items to insert while keeping the original text. Supported devices compare up to 24 recent notes using an offline semantic model; if unavailable, rule-based suggestions remain, with no model downloads.",
  "摘要与行动项仍是原文摘录、规则提取，不是生成式 AI。语义相近不代表内容一定相关，插入前请确认。": "Summaries and action items are excerpts and rule-based extractions, not generative AI. Similarity does not guarantee relevance; review suggestions before inserting them.",
  "快捷键与数据导出": "Keyboard shortcuts and exports",
  "支持键盘快捷操作与完整本地数据导出。": "Use keyboard shortcuts and export your local data.",
  "思维导图：选中节点后可快速添加子主题、同级主题或折叠分支。": "Mind maps: select a node to quickly add a child or sibling, or collapse its branch.",
  "双向链接：输入 [[ 自动补全笔记，[[笔记# 补全章节；# 补全标签。![[笔记#章节]] 可嵌入内容。": "Wikilinks: type [[ to complete notes, [[note# to complete headings, and # to complete tags. Use ![[note#heading]] to embed content.",
  "桌面 Ctrl/Cmd+O 快速切换文档，Ctrl/Cmd+P 打开命令面板，Ctrl/Cmd+E 切换编辑与阅读。": "On desktop, Ctrl/Cmd+O opens the quick switcher, Ctrl/Cmd+P opens the command palette, and Ctrl/Cmd+E toggles editing and reading.",
  "搜索支持 tag:#标签、type:study、notebook:分类 等组合条件；关联面板可一键转换未链接提及。": "Combine search filters such as tag:#tag, type:study, and notebook:category. Convert unlinked mentions to links from Connections.",
  "数据导出：支持导出单篇 .md、整库 Markdown、导图 .json 及完整备份包。": "Export a single .md note, the vault as Markdown, mind maps as .json, or a full backup.",
